# Normalize text files to LF in the repository regardless of each contributor's
# git config, so CRLF never enters a commit. Git auto-detects binary files and
# leaves them untouched. Working trees stay platform-native (a Windows checkout
# gets CRLF via core.autocrlf); the Prettier gate tolerates that via
# "endOfLine": "auto" in .prettierrc.json.
* text=auto
